**/results/
**/outputs/
/MuCiRAG/analysis/*.json
/MuCiRAG/analysis/*.jsonl
/MuCiRAG/analysis/*.csv
/MuCiRAG/analysis/*.png
/MuCiRAG/analysis/*.svg
